---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="The Guide">
  <h1>The Guide</h1>

  <p>
    The Guide is a companion for reading, studying, praying,
    reflecting, remembering, and walking with Scripture.
  </p>

  <p>
    It is not a replacement for Scripture, but a collection of
    practices and reflections gathered while learning
    to walk faithfully with God.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>New Here?</h2>

    <p>
      If this is your first time visiting The Guide, begin here.
    </p>

    <a href="/library/introduction/purpose-of-the-guide">
      Start the Journey →
    </a>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The Library</h2>

    <p>
      The Library gathers every shelf and every book within
      The Guide into one place.
    </p>

    <p>
      Each shelf focuses on a different part of the journey 
      from learning to read Scripture carefully to prayer,
      reflection, remembrance, faithful walking, and more.
      Whether you're looking for something specific or simply
      want to explore, you're welcome to browse at your own pace.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="/library">
        Enter the Library →
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>